WEBVTT

00:00:03.003 --> 00:00:04.971
There! Here I go!

00:00:09.109 --> 00:00:10.873
Excuse me... Senior Mamiya?

00:00:13.113 --> 00:00:16.879
If you like, you can use this.

00:00:18.818 --> 00:00:19.751
Oh, thanks a lot!

00:00:19.819 --> 00:00:22.686
Otaru! If you need a towel,
you can use mine!

00:00:23.690 --> 00:00:26.352
Yo, Otaru. Is this what
they call "youthful glow"?

00:00:26.426 --> 00:00:27.757
Here, wipe it of f with this.

00:00:27.827 --> 00:00:31.889
GET AWAY FROM HIM, YOU™!
He doesn't appreciate the attention!

00:00:44.344 --> 00:00:46.312
I had another weird dream...

00:01:10.370 --> 00:01:13.601
| came to this land to protect you.

00:01:13.973 --> 00:01:17.170
| was born to be with you.

00:01:17.544 --> 00:01:20.514
The moment I awoke...

00:01:21.147 --> 00:01:24.640
...prisms surrounded me.

00:01:24.818 --> 00:01:28.083
I'm here to love you now.

00:01:28.455 --> 00:01:31.891
I was born to hold you.

00:01:32.092 --> 00:01:35.062
Lies and truths...

00:01:35.795 --> 00:01:39.254
...are all within ourselves.

00:01:40.066 --> 00:01:44.230
The days I abandon my true feelings...

00:01:44.304 --> 00:01:45.794
...won't get to me.

00:01:46.206 --> 00:01:49.437
Tenderness and caring...

00:01:49.809 --> 00:01:52.870
...can be ours once again!

00:01:53.246 --> 00:01:57.493
Within the eyes
of a puppet on a string.

00:01:57.517 --> 00:02:01.297
Heart shaken by a dream
that someone else contrived for me.

00:02:01.321 --> 00:02:04.733
The courage to discard
the rusted screws...

00:02:04.757 --> 00:02:09.490
...is starting to awaken inside of me.

00:02:18.972 --> 00:02:21.202
Now, then...
Lime's data...

00:02:21.274 --> 00:02:25.233
...should still be intact
within Rubens' parting gift.

00:02:31.784 --> 00:02:35.049
Well, well...! I never would have
imagined she had matured this far.

00:02:35.121 --> 00:02:37.112
Fuhrer, we must act quickly...

00:02:37.190 --> 00:02:40.182
Goddel. Hasten the
completion of Leopard.

00:02:40.260 --> 00:02:41.728
Yes, m'Lord!

00:02:42.529 --> 00:02:44.623
92.5%...

00:02:44.697 --> 00:02:47.928
If this is due to the power
of Otaru Mamiya's love...

00:02:48.001 --> 00:02:51.232
...what sort of power does he have?

00:02:55.041 --> 00:02:56.702
Otaru Mamiya...

00:02:58.111 --> 00:03:03.192
The Big Barbecue Party
Of Darkness And Light

00:03:03.216 --> 00:03:04.775
"Kasahari Apartments”

00:03:11.624 --> 00:03:13.149
It's a great day!

00:03:13.226 --> 00:03:15.490
Hey, Otaru. Ready to go?

00:03:15.562 --> 00:03:18.190
Yeah! Hey, guys!
Let's shove off!

00:03:18.264 --> 00:03:19.732
Coming"!

00:03:22.702 --> 00:03:26.104
<i>YAY,YAYY
A barbecue, a barbecue!</i>

00:03:28.308 --> 00:03:30.970
I'm goin' to a barbecue with Otaru!

00:03:32.946 --> 00:03:35.142
It's awfully generous of you
to throw a barbecue party...

00:03:35.215 --> 00:03:36.944
...to celebrate Lime's recovery.

00:03:37.016 --> 00:03:40.816
Oh, we'll take any excuse to
have a party. Don't worry about it!

00:03:41.721 --> 00:03:43.621
All right then, we'll
accept your hospitality.

00:03:43.690 --> 00:03:46.455
At least, let us
carry your things!

00:03:46.526 --> 00:03:48.927
Yes, let us take those!

00:03:48.995 --> 00:03:50.087
Me, too! Me, too!

00:03:50.163 --> 00:03:51.858
You don't have to do that, Lime!

00:03:51.931 --> 00:03:53.729
Huh? Why not?

00:03:53.800 --> 00:03:55.268
It's okay, it's okay!

00:03:55.335 --> 00:03:57.201
Yeah! Today, you're the star!

00:03:57.270 --> 00:04:00.934
You hear that, Lime? Today,
you gotta let them treat you.

00:04:01.007 --> 00:04:02.668
If you say so, Otaru!

00:04:02.742 --> 00:04:04.267
Okay, let's head out!

00:04:08.681 --> 00:04:10.615
Hey, don't flaunt it.

00:04:11.117 --> 00:04:12.607
We won't let you have any steak.

00:04:13.886 --> 00:04:16.981
Y-You dummies! I wasn't trying to...
She just latched on to me!

00:04:18.291 --> 00:04:22.023
Hey! What're you doing?!
Don't go hitting Otaru!

00:04:22.095 --> 00:04:24.996
You sure are quiet
today, Bloodberry.

00:04:25.064 --> 00:04:27.931
Usually, you shout
"HEY, LIME!"

00:04:28.001 --> 00:04:29.992
...and have a fit.

00:04:30.069 --> 00:04:31.969
Well, it's not like
it didn't annoy me...

00:04:32.038 --> 00:04:33.938
...but for some reason...

00:04:34.340 --> 00:04:37.002
If you pick on Otaru,
I'll make you sorry!!

00:04:37.076 --> 00:04:38.168
Aw, Lime...

00:04:38.244 --> 00:04:39.541
Lime...?

00:04:40.913 --> 00:04:42.381
What's wrong, Lime?

00:04:45.652 --> 00:04:47.620
| just...thought I...

00:04:48.688 --> 00:04:50.679
No, I'm just imagining
things! It's nothing!

00:04:52.325 --> 00:04:53.918
It's nothing, it's nothing!

00:04:53.993 --> 00:04:56.553
Now that you mention it,
aren't we missing somebody?

00:04:56.629 --> 00:04:58.791
Huh? No, everybody's right here.

00:04:58.865 --> 00:05:00.697
Oh, all right then.

00:05:00.767 --> 00:05:03.429
All right then!
Barbecue! Barbecue!

00:05:03.503 --> 00:05:04.993
"Hana"

00:05:05.772 --> 00:05:07.866
Otaru...

00:05:07.940 --> 00:05:08.907
...love you, love you...

00:05:08.975 --> 00:05:10.465
Otaru, I love...

00:05:14.113 --> 00:05:19.552
| said I was sorry. C'mon,
quit sulking already, Hanagata.

00:05:19.686 --> 00:05:23.145
It's not like we MEANT to
leave you behind or anything...

00:05:23.723 --> 00:05:25.555
HMPH! I'd hardly expect
YOU to understand!

00:05:26.292 --> 00:05:28.693
You'd never understand how
it felt to wake up alone...

00:05:28.761 --> 00:05:31.355
...to a cold,
drafty apartment...

00:05:31.964 --> 00:05:35.628
It felt SO lonely, Otaru!

00:05:35.702 --> 00:05:40.264
Okay, okay... Just get changed
out of those revolting pajamas.

00:05:40.340 --> 00:05:41.603
"Revolting"?!

00:05:42.008 --> 00:05:43.772
Otaru in the front!

00:05:43.943 --> 00:05:46.002
Otaru in the back!

00:05:46.079 --> 00:05:48.241
| will not forget you,
even when I am asleep...

00:05:48.314 --> 00:05:50.248
...my love for you never sleeps!

00:05:51.017 --> 00:05:53.042
But, for all that,
you... You...!

00:05:56.122 --> 00:05:58.955
| should never, EVER
have tried to humor you!

00:05:59.025 --> 00:06:01.926
Hey, Hanagata. Would you go
and pick up some things for us?

00:06:01.994 --> 00:06:04.622
Why me? I refuse!

00:06:04.697 --> 00:06:05.630
You're such a child.

00:06:05.698 --> 00:06:07.792
Yes, I am a child.
| didn't wake up on time...

00:06:07.867 --> 00:06:10.029
...and everybody just left without me!

00:06:10.103 --> 00:06:11.798
I'm a poor little child!

00:06:12.372 --> 00:06:13.703
Oh, stay that way.

00:06:13.773 --> 00:06:15.673
What do you need, Gen?

00:06:15.742 --> 00:06:18.074
We forgot to bring the plates.

00:06:18.511 --> 00:06:21.606
By coincidence, a friend of
mine runs a pottery business...

00:06:21.681 --> 00:06:25.083
...a little ways upstream. |
thought that he might lend us some.

00:06:25.151 --> 00:06:26.676
| could get them for you.

00:06:26.753 --> 00:06:31.088
You could? Thanks. Just
mention my name to the owner.

00:06:31.457 --> 00:06:33.221
Okay! I'll be back soon!

00:06:34.026 --> 00:06:38.088
Hey, Gen! This generator isn't
turning over! You think it's broken?

00:06:39.332 --> 00:06:42.199
What're you blabbering
about now? Let me have a try.

00:06:46.305 --> 00:06:47.636
Huh? That's funny...

00:06:47.707 --> 00:06:51.109
- Hey, hey! Have you seen Otaru?
- He went out on an errand.

00:06:51.344 --> 00:06:55.076
What?! He should have
asked me to come with him!

00:06:55.148 --> 00:06:58.914
He'll be back soon. While you're here,
Lime... Give this a pull, would you?

00:06:58.985 --> 00:07:02.250
- I should just pull it?
- Yup. A good, hard pull!

00:07:02.321 --> 00:07:05.416
- A good, hard pull?
- Yup, good and hard...

00:07:05.491 --> 00:07:07.516
NO, WAIT!
A light pull will be fine!

00:07:17.170 --> 00:07:18.695
Ooh! Aah!

00:07:35.021 --> 00:07:36.682
Whoa...

00:07:38.191 --> 00:07:39.989
These are really NICE...

00:07:40.927 --> 00:07:45.262
Here you are. I'm just sorry
that none of them match...

00:07:45.331 --> 00:07:47.060
Oh, no! That's perfectly okay!

00:07:47.133 --> 00:07:49.158
I'm sorry about coming
out of the blue like that.

00:07:49.335 --> 00:07:53.670
Oh, don't you worry about that.
Please tell Gennai |I said hi.

00:07:53.973 --> 00:07:55.941
| will! And thanks for the plates!

00:08:06.118 --> 00:08:07.984
Excuse me!

00:08:08.054 --> 00:08:11.251
But, doesn't it take a
lot of time to bake these?

00:08:11.791 --> 00:08:15.352
Oh, those? Actually,
we do it a different way here.

00:08:16.062 --> 00:08:17.325
A plasma kiln?!

00:08:17.396 --> 00:08:22.891
Yes. We use subterranean plasma
accumulations to bake our pottery.

00:08:22.969 --> 00:08:26.872
Using this, it only takes one
tenth of the regular baking time.

00:08:27.373 --> 00:08:30.001
It's very tricky to use, though...

00:08:30.076 --> 00:08:33.603
Sometimes we fail because of
the delicate nature of plasma.

00:08:33.679 --> 00:08:35.909
About how long would one tenth
of the regular baking time be?

00:08:35.982 --> 00:08:40.920
Well, for example... A small plate
would be ready in 20-30 minutes.

00:08:40.987 --> 00:08:44.514
Wow... Actually,
could I ask a favor?

00:08:50.363 --> 00:08:52.331
He sure is late.

00:08:55.067 --> 00:08:56.330
LIME!

00:08:56.402 --> 00:08:59.963
Stop churning up the water!
You'll scare all of the fish away!

00:09:00.039 --> 00:09:02.474
- I'm not churning up the water.
- LIAR!

00:09:02.542 --> 00:09:06.172
But I'm not! THIS is
how you churn up water!!

00:09:21.394 --> 00:09:22.987
8..Stop it, Lime!

00:09:42.114 --> 00:09:43.741
The river...

00:09:44.550 --> 00:09:46.018
I'm tired of fishing.

00:09:56.996 --> 00:09:58.464
Okay!

00:10:10.776 --> 00:10:14.007
We are at Level 9,
the final substance test.

00:10:14.080 --> 00:10:15.548
Begin.

00:10:54.687 --> 00:10:56.155
What's that?

00:11:00.092 --> 00:11:01.560
It can't be!

00:11:33.592 --> 00:11:35.287
The plasma clouds!

00:11:45.705 --> 00:11:47.503
As |I live and breathe...

00:11:47.573 --> 00:11:50.565
...it's a plasma-diffusion
system! He's perfected it!

00:11:51.410 --> 00:11:54.937
The plasma clouds above Gartlant
have been diffused.

00:11:55.014 --> 00:11:57.312
Amount of plasma energy
remaining in the air hole, zero.

00:11:58.050 --> 00:11:59.540
It's a success, fuhrer.

00:12:01.287 --> 00:12:02.948
It won't be long now.

00:12:03.022 --> 00:12:06.083
The stage is set.
All we need are the actors.

00:12:06.158 --> 00:12:07.990
But hear this, Otaru Mamiya...

00:12:08.060 --> 00:12:10.586
...I am not about to
relinquish my part to you.

00:12:15.101 --> 00:12:17.092
You can be certain of that.

00:12:34.720 --> 00:12:36.381
That certainly
came out of nowhere.

00:12:36.455 --> 00:12:39.584
The weather has been
known to be fickle.

00:12:39.658 --> 00:12:43.253
Still... the clouds sure seem
to be in an awful hurry.

00:12:43.763 --> 00:12:45.731
You think? Oh, you're
just imagining things.

00:12:46.632 --> 00:12:47.690
Otaru...

00:12:47.767 --> 00:12:50.031
Lime, he'll be back soon!

00:12:50.102 --> 00:12:52.093
But what if something's
happened to him?

00:12:52.171 --> 00:12:54.139
Everything's fine, Lime. See?

00:12:58.811 --> 00:13:00.040
Aw, man!

00:13:00.112 --> 00:13:02.410
Otaru, where have you been?!

00:13:02.481 --> 00:13:03.971
| went to borrow some plates.

00:13:04.049 --> 00:13:05.380
Well, you took too long!

00:13:05.451 --> 00:13:08.443
Hey, Cherry! Could
you pass me a towel?

00:13:08.521 --> 00:13:10.353
- Sure!
- Thanks.

00:13:10.656 --> 00:13:11.623
Hey, Otaru...

00:13:11.690 --> 00:13:13.988
Oh, Bloodberry! Would
you take these from me?

00:13:14.059 --> 00:13:15.288
Gotcha.

00:13:15.361 --> 00:13:19.161
Man, oh, man...
I'm sopping wet!

00:13:22.067 --> 00:13:23.626
- Psst, Otaru...
-Wha?

00:13:26.071 --> 00:13:28.563
Lime? What are you
all upset about?

00:13:28.641 --> 00:13:30.040
I'm not upset!

00:13:30.109 --> 00:13:31.634
Sure, you are!

00:13:32.711 --> 00:13:34.201
Hey, Lime?!

00:13:35.314 --> 00:13:36.782
I'M NOT UPSET!!

00:13:37.783 --> 00:13:39.911
Lime?!

00:13:39.985 --> 00:13:41.453
What's with her?

00:13:47.726 --> 00:13:49.194
I'm not upset...

00:13:56.101 --> 00:13:58.069
...stupid Otaru.

00:14:22.127 --> 00:14:23.595
Lorelei...

00:14:25.130 --> 00:14:27.098
Don't lose hope, Lorelei!

00:14:27.499 --> 00:14:29.160
You mustn't give up!

00:14:29.235 --> 00:14:30.430
Faust...

00:14:30.502 --> 00:14:32.596
There has to be some way!
There has to!!

00:14:33.439 --> 00:14:34.702
Ieyasu...

00:14:34.773 --> 00:14:38.676
I swear to you, Lorelei!
I'll come for you!

00:14:38.744 --> 00:14:40.212
| swear it!!

00:14:40.279 --> 00:14:42.611
| understand, Faust...

00:14:43.482 --> 00:14:45.450
I'll wait for you!

00:14:47.753 --> 00:14:50.017
It won't be much longer, Lorelei.

00:14:51.523 --> 00:14:53.651
Finally, after 300 years...

00:15:06.138 --> 00:15:07.833
Hey, Lime! Your steak is ready!

00:15:08.841 --> 00:15:10.366
Hey, Lime!

00:15:11.110 --> 00:15:14.705
But she was looking so forward
to this barbecue... Lime?!

00:15:14.780 --> 00:15:18.774
Honestly... What's her problem?
It's so TASTY, too...

00:15:19.184 --> 00:15:22.119
Hey, Hanagata! I had
dibs on that piece!

00:15:22.187 --> 00:15:24.986
Nuts to that.
First come, first served!

00:15:25.057 --> 00:15:27.617
That's what barbecues
are all about!

00:15:29.695 --> 00:15:31.254
You little sneak thief!

00:15:31.330 --> 00:15:32.695
Oh, yummy-yums!

00:15:32.765 --> 00:15:35.132
Hey, your Hana-ness!
This one's ready, too.

00:15:35.200 --> 00:15:37.134
Why, thank you
kindly, Bloodberry...

00:15:41.206 --> 00:15:45.165
Bloodberry!! This is a rock!
What the hell are you thinking?!

00:15:45.244 --> 00:15:49.613
I never said it was a steak.
I merely said it was ready.

00:15:51.483 --> 00:15:52.951
Master Otaru...?

00:15:57.089 --> 00:15:58.614
Yeesh...

00:16:00.125 --> 00:16:01.684
This is terrible!

00:16:02.227 --> 00:16:03.626
What is it, Gen?

00:16:03.696 --> 00:16:06.597
Well, something about those clouds
bothered me, so I looked into it...

00:16:06.665 --> 00:16:09.965
...but the subterranean magnetic
field has become so unstable...

00:16:10.035 --> 00:16:12.629
...that it's impossible get a
decent plasma reading from it.

00:16:12.705 --> 00:16:14.764
What the heck is
going on down there?

00:16:15.441 --> 00:16:18.035
You're a true scientist,
through and through.

00:16:19.244 --> 00:16:20.837
The plasma is unstable??!

00:16:24.116 --> 00:16:25.606
Huh?

00:16:26.285 --> 00:16:28.811
- Master Otaru?
- Otaru! Where are you going?!

00:16:30.389 --> 00:16:31.754
Otaru?

00:16:38.664 --> 00:16:40.132
Hey, Mister!

00:16:46.872 --> 00:16:48.169
Oh, no...

00:16:49.074 --> 00:16:51.270
Oh, it's you, Otaru.
Just look at this.

00:16:52.077 --> 00:16:53.567
This is horrible...

00:16:54.146 --> 00:16:58.379
Maybe plasma was never
meant to be tamed by man.

00:16:59.752 --> 00:17:01.720
But cheer up, Otaru.

00:17:02.755 --> 00:17:04.382
You are a very fortunate man.

00:17:07.226 --> 00:17:08.694
Y-You mean?!

00:17:13.565 --> 00:17:15.727
Fortunate...? Ha.

00:17:19.772 --> 00:17:22.673
| wonder where Master
Otaru could have gone?

00:17:26.445 --> 00:17:28.880
- Otaru!
- Master Otaru!!

00:17:31.750 --> 00:17:34.685
Why'd you just
run of f like that?

00:17:34.753 --> 00:17:36.983
0-Oh, just because.

00:17:37.056 --> 00:17:40.219
Otaru... you look sad.
Are you okay?

00:17:40.292 --> 00:17:42.158
I'm fine! It's nothing.

00:17:43.762 --> 00:17:46.663
Otaru... I'm sorry
| got so upset.

00:17:47.599 --> 00:17:49.931
It's just that I was
really, really worried...

00:17:50.002 --> 00:17:52.300
...because you took
so long to get back...

00:17:52.371 --> 00:17:55.102
...but then when you did, you would
only talk to Cherry and Bloodberry...

00:17:55.174 --> 00:17:56.664
...but not to me.

00:17:56.742 --> 00:17:57.766
Lime...

00:17:57.843 --> 00:18:00.073
But Grampa Gennai and Hannie...

00:18:00.145 --> 00:18:03.825
...and everybody else all
feel bad because of me.

00:18:03.849 --> 00:18:05.317
I'm sorry.

00:18:06.385 --> 00:18:09.616
No, it was my fault too.
| apologize.

00:18:09.688 --> 00:18:11.087
I'm sorry, Lime.

00:18:12.057 --> 00:18:13.525
Otaru!

00:18:22.101 --> 00:18:24.263
Caught you!
That was close.

00:18:25.104 --> 00:18:26.003
Hey, what's this?

00:18:26.071 --> 00:18:29.166
Oh, my! Is this me?

00:18:29.508 --> 00:18:33.172
Master Otaru, did
you make this for me?

00:18:33.345 --> 00:18:34.642
Uh... Well...

00:18:34.713 --> 00:18:38.172
It's been almost a year
since we all first met, so...

00:18:39.017 --> 00:18:41.349
Thank you so much!!
I'll treasure it always!

00:18:41.420 --> 00:18:44.048
Does that mean there's one
for me too, Otaru?

00:18:44.123 --> 00:18:45.989
Yeah... Well...

00:18:46.058 --> 00:18:48.789
Aw, c'mon! Don't be so shy!
Fork over the bag!

00:18:52.965 --> 00:18:55.900
It doesn't look a THING like me,
but it's me all right!

00:18:57.002 --> 00:18:59.130
- Thank you, Otaru!
- Y-You're welcome.

00:18:59.972 --> 00:19:01.303
Lime...

00:19:01.373 --> 00:19:04.604
There were only two
teacups in the bag.

00:19:05.177 --> 00:19:06.187
Th-That's because...

00:19:06.211 --> 00:19:07.679
I don't get one.

00:19:08.113 --> 00:19:10.104
Lime... Listen...

00:19:10.182 --> 00:19:13.880
But, that's the way it is. After
all, when you made the teacups...

00:19:13.952 --> 00:19:18.048
...I hadn't apologized yet.
It's my own fault.

00:19:18.123 --> 00:19:19.613
Lime...

00:19:20.726 --> 00:19:22.956
-I don't want it.
-I agree.

00:19:23.028 --> 00:19:26.123
If she doesn't get one...
..I can't accept this.

00:19:27.366 --> 00:19:30.211
We're a three-piece set.

00:19:30.235 --> 00:19:34.382
We all love you, and we want
you to love all of us.

00:19:34.406 --> 00:19:36.374
It may sound strange,
but recently, it feels like...

00:19:36.441 --> 00:19:38.375
...that is the way it should be.

00:19:38.777 --> 00:19:44.045
It's like we three wouldn't be
complete without every one of us.

00:19:44.116 --> 00:19:45.709
You guys...

00:19:45.784 --> 00:19:49.379
That's why... I'm sorry,
but we can't accept these.

00:19:51.456 --> 00:19:53.823
Actually..I've got one for her.

00:19:54.893 --> 00:19:56.759
I made a cup for Lime, too.

00:19:57.696 --> 00:19:59.061
Where is it, then?

00:19:59.131 --> 00:20:03.090
Well, there was an accident
with the plasma kiln, and...

00:20:03.168 --> 00:20:04.897
...look what happened to it.

00:20:05.204 --> 00:20:08.640
It was supposed to be a teacup,
but this looks more like a teaBOWL!

00:20:08.707 --> 00:20:10.175
And lookit what happened
to the picture.

00:20:13.679 --> 00:20:16.649
See? It was supposed
to be a present, too...

00:20:17.883 --> 00:20:19.351
Lime?

00:20:21.353 --> 00:20:23.344
| look so funny!!

00:20:24.723 --> 00:20:26.623
Lime?!

00:20:26.692 --> 00:20:28.285
You got THAT right!

00:20:28.360 --> 00:20:30.294
Yes, you look simply dreadful!

00:20:32.264 --> 00:20:36.030
Thank you, Otaru! I'll take
good care of this teacup!

00:20:36.168 --> 00:20:38.193
I'll love it for ever and ever!

00:20:39.137 --> 00:20:41.299
Lime... I'm sorry, okay?

00:20:41.373 --> 00:20:43.273
Just don't let it happen again!

00:20:43.342 --> 00:20:45.310
I won't...

00:20:45.377 --> 00:20:46.845
HEY!

00:20:50.048 --> 00:20:52.278
C'mon, let's return to the party!

00:20:52.351 --> 00:20:53.841
Yeah! I'm hungry!

00:20:55.387 --> 00:20:56.946
Lime...

00:20:59.391 --> 00:21:01.359
Are you happy, Lime?

00:21:07.232 --> 00:21:09.701
Yup! I'm really happy!

00:21:10.102 --> 00:21:12.002
Who you talkin' to, Lime?

00:21:14.373 --> 00:21:16.239
I love you, Otaru!!

00:21:16.308 --> 00:21:18.003
Huh?

00:21:18.076 --> 00:21:20.443
Now, let's go have a barbecue!

00:21:30.455 --> 00:21:32.549
It is complete, fuhrer.

00:21:33.825 --> 00:21:36.021
The ultimate combat marionette...

00:21:36.695 --> 00:21:40.131
"Saber Beast Leopard.”

00:21:42.134 --> 00:21:44.068
Good. The time has come.

00:21:44.336 --> 00:21:46.065
GO, LEOPARD!

00:21:47.005 --> 00:21:49.064
Get me the three maiden circuits"

00:22:11.730 --> 00:22:15.428
When you're sad, when you're blue...

00:22:15.500 --> 00:22:19.198
...don't go off to be alone.

00:22:19.338 --> 00:22:22.205
Just think of me...

00:22:22.274 --> 00:22:26.871
...and I'll be there with you.

00:22:27.112 --> 00:22:30.844
Strength is a very important thing...

00:22:30.916 --> 00:22:34.614
...but tears are important, too.

00:22:34.753 --> 00:22:38.533
You can't do anything at all...

00:22:38.557 --> 00:22:40.335
...with a dried-up heart.

00:22:40.359 --> 00:22:44.353
You can't feel a thing.

00:22:46.465 --> 00:22:48.729
Tell me, why do people hide...

00:22:48.800 --> 00:22:53.829
...what they really feel inside?

00:22:53.972 --> 00:22:57.567
Take what you can do,
what you want to do...

00:22:57.809 --> 00:23:01.473
...one step at a time.

00:23:01.613 --> 00:23:05.311
I love the way you don't care...

00:23:05.384 --> 00:23:09.184
...how you have been
programmed to live.

00:23:09.321 --> 00:23:12.780
| would follow you anywhere.

00:23:13.158 --> 00:23:19.621
I'll never, ever let you go.

00:23:28.673 --> 00:23:30.539
Good afternoon, I am Cherry!

00:23:30.609 --> 00:23:33.203
What? Master Otaru
must kill Faust?

00:23:33.278 --> 00:23:36.009
Lorelei... Maiden circuits...
The Mesopotamia...

00:23:36.081 --> 00:23:38.709
What on earth happened
300 years ago?

00:23:38.784 --> 00:23:42.345
Oh, my! That's Gartlant's
ultimate weapon, "Leopard"!

00:23:42.421 --> 00:23:45.220
Lime, run!! You
have to stay alive!

00:23:45.290 --> 00:23:47.315
No matter what happens,
you must protect Master Otaru!

00:23:47.392 --> 00:23:51.158
Soaring Emotion
Next on Saber Marionette J!

00:23:51.229 --> 00:23:53.357
Master Otaru, I love you!!
